{"about_the_game":"<strong>Medal Winners 24</strong> is a sports game that captures the excitement and competition of the Summer Games. You compete in a variety of sports in a unique retro 2D cartoony style.<br><br>Single Player Mode: Compete in events against AI opponents, aiming to win more medals than your rivals in this tournament-style gameplay. You'll face procedurally generated rivals, ensuring each tournament is different and presents new challenges.<br><br>Two Player Mode: Grab a friend or family member for some friendly competition in local multiplayer matches. You have the choice to cooperate or face off against each other.<br><br>Story Mode: Immerse yourself in the Games journey through a captivating narrative where you create your own story filled with challenges and victories.<br><br>Fantasy Mode: Play fantastic events with special characters like animals, ghosts, aliens, mythological beings, etc.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2645800?t=1746832448","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746832448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746832448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746832448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2781610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<strong>Medal Winners 24</strong> is a